# omega elicitation build products. Both regenerate in seconds from committed
# inputs, and a 500 KB matrix in a diff is not reviewable either way.
#   packs.json    <- elicit_omega.py pack, from pdac_priors + the .m + model_structure
#   omega_corr.*  <- elicit_omega.py build-matrix, from loadings.json + omega_axes.yaml
parameters/omega_corr.csv
parameters/omega_corr.npz
.jax_cache/

